<% location = [ @application.letter_venue, @application.letter_address, @application.letter_city, @application.letter_country ].compact_blank.uniq.join(", ") %>
Your Visa Letter is Ready!

Hello <%= @application.full_name %>,

Great news! Your visa letter application for <%= @application.letter_event_name %> has been approved. Your letter is attached to this email.

Download Your Visa Letter (PDF): <%= @download_url %>

Event Details
- Event: <%= @application.letter_event_name %>
- Dates: <%= @application.letter_date_range %>
- Location: <%= location %>
- Reference Number: <%= @application.reference_number %>

Next Steps
Please print this letter and include it with your visa application. If you have any questions or need additional documentation, please contact us at <%= @support_email %>.

We look forward to seeing you at <%= @application.letter_event_name %>!
